R8R8Q7kNvwHHhCul&_nc_oc=AdrivEknsND8hyIHD61zfVK44GqDBH5gwrXgVWKN7CNmwP0igLLwZRCBlwMeTchsHO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLEtbVrqgGRBQbJ4443jBmeD0MBMJJRuLyk4XojKU6ytQ&oe=6ABD1AD1"}, {"file_name": "image2.png", "id": "721416448761269", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974485_721416452094602_3114108283674214139_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qZXpuXYU8zoQ7kNvwGZACoZ&_nc_oc=AdqGF-MatcV_j1Vg_NXHBmiRfMES7yversi8xOZCXdfJnHnJ4bTBNaWQ3BwSuskndv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKSJ2qWjysxc3TYnyXLE9E4BViUXtcQgnxZ7lZ1GYJ5-w&oe=6ABD2CA7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ANSUZ", "keywords": ["boardgame", "tabletop", "multiplay", "amongus", "mafia"], "long_description": "Your words and your magic will change the world.\n\nANSUZ is a VR werewolf game in which players are divided into two forces.\n\nGood and evil roles are randomly assigned to the 4 players. If you are good, try to find the evil, and if you are evil, try to avoid being found by the good. Use your own words to skillfully argue for victory. When good wins, it will bring peace to the world; when evil wins, it will bring ruin to the world...\n\nANSUZ is a table talk game played in VR.\nAnima and Moon look for and nominate a beaster.\nBeaster must lie to Anima and Moon so that they don't find him.\nLoki must stir the pot and change the course of the game!", "short_description": "Your words and your magic will change the world.\n\nANSUZ is a VR werewolf game in which players are divided into two forces.\n\nGood and evil roles are randomly assigned to the 4 players. If you are good, try to find the evil, and if you are evil, try to avoid being found by the good. Use your own words to skillfully argue for victory. When good wins, it will bring peace to the world; when evil wins, it will bring ruin to the world..."}]}, "developer_name": "CharacterBank inc.", "develo